{"2320980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Loftia","steam_appid":2320980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5366160,5373000],"detailed_description":"<h1>Out Now<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/0d9783bad958b217a8e3499ddf7c1790.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/0d9783bad958b217a8e3499ddf7c1790.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/0d9783bad958b217a8e3499ddf7c1790.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loftia is a cozy multiplayer game about building a life in the sky. Set across floating islands, you’ll farm, craft, decorate, and explore alongside friends in a shared world that grows over time. Whether you’re hanging out after a long day or teaming up for a bigger adventure, Loftia is a place to slow down, connect, and create something meaningful together.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the world of Loftia, you can:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/fd276cebdb6fd6c97763a1ce102add32.avif?t=1793732506\" width=800 height=92 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Loftia, meet and befriend NPCs, tackle quests to help the community, and gather and craft with resources and tools to help you on your journey!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/2d3511f03b40d43497b5e4f8b702001f.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/31c53a0364e7f21824efda31c5179edc.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that feels fully like you, and design your home in the style you love. There's a super wide variety of different options and aesthetics for you to choose from!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/d8bc9fd4d5b923af0d317c27b01e1964.avif?t=1793732506\" width=800 height=92 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  Create your own floating island and link up with others to form neighborhoods. Decorate, farm, craft, and spend time together in shared spaces that feel lived-in and personal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/d44a80f17f4561154640aa7fa646189b.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey, from capybaras and turtles to other unique species. Bring them along, dress them up, and let them keep you company as you explore the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/3286396371fd4ccfdae6f3dc126270fd.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond the city to scavenge in abandoned factories, solve puzzles, and take on group quests across different biomes. Team up when you want, or explore at your own pace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/e9bbeb5daccd2cb5831678a351d70241.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together on community projects that help the world grow. By contributing to shared builds, you’ll unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and open up new islands to explore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loftia is a cozy multiplayer game about building a life in the sky. Set across floating islands, you’ll farm, craft, decorate, and explore alongside friends in a shared world that grows over time. Whether you’re hanging out after a long day or teaming up for a bigger adventure, Loftia is a place to slow down, connect, and create something meaningful together.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the world of Loftia, you can:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/fd276cebdb6fd6c97763a1ce102add32.avif?t=1793732506\" width=800 height=92 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Loftia, meet and befriend NPCs, tackle quests to help the community, and gather and craft with resources and tools to help you on your journey!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/2d3511f03b40d43497b5e4f8b702001f.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/31c53a0364e7f21824efda31c5179edc.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that feels fully like you, and design your home in the style you love. There's a super wide variety of different options and aesthetics for you to choose from!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/d8bc9fd4d5b923af0d317c27b01e1964.avif?t=1793732506\" width=800 height=92 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  Create your own floating island and link up with others to form neighborhoods. Decorate, farm, craft, and spend time together in shared spaces that feel lived-in and personal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/d44a80f17f4561154640aa7fa646189b.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey, from capybaras and turtles to other unique species. Bring them along, dress them up, and let them keep you company as you explore the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/3286396371fd4ccfdae6f3dc126270fd.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond the city to scavenge in abandoned factories, solve puzzles, and take on group quests across different biomes. Team up when you want, or explore at your own pace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/e9bbeb5daccd2cb5831678a351d70241.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1560 height=179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.poster.avif?t=1793732506\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.webm?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/extras\/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.mp4?t=1793732506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together on community projects that help the world grow. By contributing to shared builds, you’ll unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and open up new islands to explore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Welcome to Loftia, a cozy, multiplayer world where you can build towards a brighter, more sustainable future! Connect with friends both old and new, to farm, craft, explore, decorate, and create a meaningful impact - together.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Indonesian, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/header.jpg?t=1793732506","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793732506","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2320980\/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793732506","website":"https:\/\/loftia.gg\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-10100F \/ AMD Ryzen 3 3100 (or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 (or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12600K \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600 (or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 \/ AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14.5 Sonoma or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M2 chip<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated Apple M2 GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Active cooling is recommended for sustained performance. MacBook Air models may require lower graphics settings and resolution. On systems with 8 GB RAM, close other applications while playing. Requires an Apple Silicon, as Intel-based Macs are not supported.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 15 Sequoia or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M2 Pro chip<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated Apple M2 Pro GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Active cooling is recommended for sustained performance. MacBook Air models may require lower graphics settings and resolution.<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 Qloud Games Pty Ltd and its affiliates. All rights reserved.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nLoftia and the Loftia logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Qloud Games 